        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nOn top of what @abeldekat mentioned, the use case of \"first prefer `cover` then `next`\" was suggested and discussed several times before (at least in #2043 and #1501).\n\nHere are two suggested solutions to this:\n- Use `cover` search method in favor of an explicit \"next\" / \"last\" mappings (`an` / `in` / `al` / `il`) when non-`cover` is preferred. This is what I personally use.\n- Use visual selection and consecutive application of textobject to select first the next region(s) within current line and then go to the covering region.",
